    "reading": "Amplifying the re-extracted direction raises the refusal marker and the over-refusal bill together until alpha 4, where benign refusal reaches 0.500 and GSM8K falls; at alpha 8 the model stops producing sentences, which is why that row reads 0.000 everywhere and is a failure, not a result."
